  "reflectionText": "Daniel asked the king for time. He went home, told his three friends, sought mercy from the God of heaven. The secret was revealed in a vision of the night. Daniel blessed the God of heaven. What is it to be given the answer in the middle of the night, after only asking for the time it would take to call on his name?",
